ncement bonus\">+5 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +5 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Armor_Class\" title=\"Armor Class\">Armor Class</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Displacement\" title=\"Displacement\">Displacement</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Displacement\" title=\"Displacement\">Displacement</a></b><br /><b>Caster level:</b> 5<br /><b>Charges: </b>5 (2/day)</span></span> <b>—</b> 5 Charges&#32;(Recharged/Day:2)</li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Attack_bonus\" title=\"Attack bonus\">Attack Bonus +2</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Attack_bonus\" title=\"Attack bonus\">Attack Bonus +2</a>:</b> Provides a +2 <a href=\"/page/Competence_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">competence bonus</a> to your <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack rolls</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Jump_(skill)\" title=\"Jump (skill)\">Jump +10</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" cla